# Testing and Done Criteria Rules

A backend change is complete only when:

- Typecheck passes (`pnpm typecheck`)
- Lint passes for touched files (`pnpm lint`)
- Relevant tests are executed for changed behavior
- i18n updates are present in both locales when needed
- API contract remains stable unless change is explicitly planned
